Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream,\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll carry on till we see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Linlin, you shall pay with your\Nlife for what you have done to Elba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,More similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop, Lin-Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She's fearful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll hold her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch that girl already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have Simla here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's some for the\Nfestival in the storehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then fetch it now. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, what are you\Ndoing? It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Giver, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall give you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name shall be Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have those some luck!\NHurry! Give it to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're in the limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Blamesimmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your town is no longer ablaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But look, the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so cute! Hiya, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She saved us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this is hardly my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, we should thank the god of\Nthe sun for showing us compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Punisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not think of that devil as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You must take swift action.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:07:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise she'll surely bring our\Npeople more pain and suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Ural.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the doctor over
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Beardhill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You must show her mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You would stop me. Why, Carmel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This monster has injured Yorul, my\Ncompanion of three hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hardly young.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear he cannot survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A voyage hurt is not decided by how\Nlong they live, but how they meet death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We must stand on the side of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who defies Elbeth's\Nlaws cannot be pardoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sympathize with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.10,0:08:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But whether she's pardoned or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Linlin is a mere child who is left\Nto the House of Lambs like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to abandon this young soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you suggest then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise to leave this place and\Ntake her far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But chief beard hill you\Ngotta punish Lin Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should we let her slide when\Nshe's taking everything from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your elbow ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove this demon from my sight at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forgive her! Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what happened to the chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't even remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yorul, the hero of the\Ngiants, has perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the hands of an unknowingly\Ndestructive child named Linlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The gruesome details of that faithful\Nday, along with word of Carmel's miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,quickly spread to the few giant\Nsettlements across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Together with the orphans\Nfrom House of Lambs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,who couldn't bear to\Nbe separated from her,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and Charlotte Linden,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,now the enemy of all giant kind, Mother\NCarmel leaves the shores. of Elbaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeking to start their lives over,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,they relocate and build a\Nbrand new House of Lambs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, finally done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize once again for\Nasking so much of you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pretty deep in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Without your assistance, I never would\Nhave been able to build a house like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means we'll never see\NLin-Lin again, it's worthwhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you're the holy\Nmother to us giants, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, we're\Nalways happy to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoping to put the nervous\Nchildren at ease, Mother Carmel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Smiled
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,warmly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,within
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.02,0:10:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,only a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,things are starting to feel\Nlike how they used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,house of lambs is once again
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,filled with children's laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:11:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look after the place while I'm away;\NI'll make sure to scrub the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be gone too long, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head straight home as soon\Nas I'm done buying the groceries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything in\Nparticular that you'd like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Very shortcake, a deck of\Ncards, some toy samurai swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I got it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Word of the House of Lambs\Nreached round the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaining a reputation for welcoming and\Nrehabilitating the most troubled children,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a place well respected by all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried you wouldn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And the entire time we've known each\Nother, have I ever stood you up once?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how about we get\Ndown to business already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have got something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected you to leave, Elbaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I really didn't want to give this one up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Five years old and has\Nthe power to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,half of a giant's village all by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But the asking price...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, that's pocket change for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Toss her in the Navy and she could be\Na vice-admiral or even fleet-admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In Cypherpoll, she'd be a coveted\Nshield for the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trafficking kids for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen a product\Nas resilient as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that stunt we\Npulled 37 years back
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that got me inside Elbaf\Nin the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have me to thank for John Giant,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the first of their kind\Nto ever serve as a marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all because of my connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,need i remind you i have been running\Nthis operation for ages without
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the children knowing and consistently\Nyou have gotten a new batch
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,from me every other year orphans\Nmake the best spies don't they no
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,family no strings attached all right\Nall right i'll get you the money
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,damn straight you will it\Nain't easy acting as the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,holy mother because of\Nthat i was kicking around
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the idea of leaving the old biz after this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,transaction this is my last\Nbig score so you're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,need to pay up money
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,bags what are you all in
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the mood to sing today\Nkids this is rude oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's a pirate song\Nthough you betcha we're
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna sail the sea someday\Nreally that does sound
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You brats will hit the seas all right,\Nafter you're sold off to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to wish you a\Nhappy birthday, Lidlund!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:14:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We know how much you love Semla,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so we made a bunch and piled them into\Nthis big old croquembouche just for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had Krieg Beach before!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.82,0:15:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The tea party?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna love, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We all get together and gather\Naround the table, sipping tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,eating desserts, and making memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.70,0:15:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds cool! Let's do it! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make some tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dig in, birthday girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She eats so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:15:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, Mother Carmel\Nmysteriously vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And it happened on the\Nday that Lin-Lin had
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the happiest birthday\Never in her entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She was surrounded by her dear friends\Nand fellow orphans at the House of Lambs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,along with her beloved,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,kind-hearted Mother Carmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Embraced by all those smiles while\Neating her delicious birthday dessert,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin was unable to hold\Nback her cries of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.34,0:16:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,These are all for you, so enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you guys are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a picture-perfect day it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't even see\Nthrough her own tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow it down, they aren't\Ngoing anywhere, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad she likes the dessert we made.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your special day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We should do this again every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck needs family when\Nwe have each other? I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What a truly wonderful birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate so much, I even took\Na bite out of the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoopsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a ton, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey buddy, I'll never\Never forget about today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother Carmel did not answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And her friends were\Nnowhere to be found. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lipplin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where you guys were, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, please don't leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wonder where everyone could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mother, why did you\Nsuddenly vanish on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go that day, dear Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 63 years ago when\NMother Carmel and the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,orphans from the House\Nof Lambs went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Big Mom herself doesn't\Nknow the fate they suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there were two people\Npresent that day who do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The first being a\Nwarrior of Elbaf who came
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,to check in on how the\Nchildren were adapting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning pale, the giant took\Noff without ever looking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He never returned to that island again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:19:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the horrific tale spread through Albath\Nand then to the other giant villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It was from that day forward\Nthat Charlotte Linlin became so
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,despised among their people that\Nthey were loath to speak her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,as if it were a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Mother! Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There was only one other\Nwitness to that horrific scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a failed cook and former pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,also living on the same\Nisland, by the name of Struzan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.10,0:20:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He found the gruesome incident amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the power of the kuk-kuk fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:21:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,this man has the ability to\Nturn any object into food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That little monster, how interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be a waste if I\Njust let her die out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll work up an appetite\Nif you keep crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What could be the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dry those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, little lady, what are\Nyour future dreams and aspirations?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep our distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She was just here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where all\Nmy friends could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't have a clue, but I bet they'll\Nall return here before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stick with me while you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to brag, but I'm a fine cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you're\Nwell-fed until they come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am pretty hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, watch what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This fateful encounter led to the\Neventual start of the Big Mom Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,who have only grown in numbers since.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.26,0:23:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to your senses!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.20,0:23:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, at the tea party today,\NWhat do you suppose will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,when we smash that picture to pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.04,0:23:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will be in utter shock\Nand we'll get at least five
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,seconds where everyone will\Nbe paralyzed from her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's the KX Launcher's time to shine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and the world will have one less Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over. You all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, why is everyone trying to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect world would be where\Neveryone lives happily as equals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.80,0:24:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you've probably never heard of a land\Nwhere all races live together peacefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.22,0:24:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I say, let's make that place here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.24,0:24:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The first country where everyone can\Nget along with one another. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.38,0:24:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's create a home\Nwithout racism or bias.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One where everyone can\Nsee things eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.96,0:24:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,See eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.68,0:24:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.52,0:24:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So that everyone will get big like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.44,0:24:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can all play\Nwithout you getting hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.76,0:24:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Sounds great! Right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:24:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy you're all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.58,0:25:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's work towards\Nthat dream, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.30,0:25:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me in! Me too! Me too! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.46,0:25:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this place into a dreamland!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.30,0:25:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work extra hard too, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.46,0:25:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a sweet girl, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If only all the other countries\Ncould think like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.86,0:25:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the world would\Ntruly be a peaceful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.62,0:25:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And in turn, everyone could\Nlive their lives happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.18,0:25:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were all going to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.62,0:25:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.24,0:25:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So is world peace your\Ndream then? How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.82,0:25:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.30,0:25:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make a land\Nthat Mother would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.88,0:25:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll figure out a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.44,0:26:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.66,0:26:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.72,0:26:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There is, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.18,0:26:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Mother's magic\Nright now. Magic? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.88,0:26:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.10,0:26:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She plays with us in a fun way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.52,0:26:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.74,0:26:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mother, okay? Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.86,0:26:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She put her hands like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.34,0:26:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower, flower, flower, flower, flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.06,0:26:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the spell she\Nused to cast. That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.56,0:26:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.34,0:26:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be a Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.24,0:27:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can do it too now, Homer!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Lin-Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.16,0:27:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all sing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.88,0:27:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.90,0:27:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking her out to sea with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.96,0:27:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.12,0:27:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that dream you mentioned!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.02,0:27:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.18,0:27:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You want everyone to see eye to eye? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.44,0:27:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lin-Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.20,0:27:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make that country.\NWe'll start today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.04,0:27:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like that? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.46,0:27:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you guys see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.44,0:27:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.04,0:27:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A 50 million bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,For a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.66,0:27:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.94,0:28:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me that a little\Ngirl destroyed the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.40,0:28:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That ain't a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.14,0:28:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cypherpole warned us to\Napproach with extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.12,0:28:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl will be\Ntroubled when she's older.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.44,0:28:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar, let's go! Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.84,0:28:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.24,0:28:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lin-Lin, company!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.30,0:28:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm eating my sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.86,0:28:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! The GPS!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.86,0:28:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost overnight, Charlotte\NLinden became a global threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.06,0:28:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She stomped down a path\Nto destruction wreaking
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.30,0:28:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,havoc everywhere she\Nand Strewson traveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.76,0:28:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Paparazzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.42,0:28:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.30,0:29:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me your finest confectionaries!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.84,0:29:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.28,0:29:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,On hand, our King!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.64,0:29:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to live\Nin a country of peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.18,0:29:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then fetch my dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.02,0:29:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure everyone's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.56,0:29:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If they don't want to get along,\Nthey're just being selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.48,0:29:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll have to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.68,0:29:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.64,0:29:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.02,0:29:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.93,0:29:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.30,0:29:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,then we'll all sit at the\Nsame table again but there
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.42,0:29:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,are still some people who\Nare not listening to me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.34,0:29:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and now i'm so sad i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,stop crying all i have is
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.10,0:30:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,one cherished photo of you\Nmother What a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.28,0:30:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They took it away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They destroyed the only\Nmemento I have left of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.60,0:30:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.38,0:30:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.24,0:30:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare the Straw Hats do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.26,0:30:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.52,0:31:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.18,0:31:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.82,0:31:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.18,0:31:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.76,0:31:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they goof it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.80,0:31:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,use your brain since i can fly i'll dive
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.78,0:31:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,onto the scene with a\Nmirror to create an easy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.08,0:31:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,escape route for everyone\Nsoon as you finish
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.32,0:31:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,your dirty words dive\Nright into season's mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.34,0:31:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,i still gotta see my job through damn it i
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.96,0:31:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,can't believe that destructive hair ruined
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.98,0:31:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,my beautiful invention i guess that's what
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.46,0:31:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,we get for messing with\Nan emperor of the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.42,0:32:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to end, Scrape boys,\Nbum rush the mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.62,0:32:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.26,0:32:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What incredible wind pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.48,0:33:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.44,0:33:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck on the roof,\Nwith nowhere to bail!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.52,0:33:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't win this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.38,0:33:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's full-scale rook time, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.42,0:33:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.02,0:34:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.26,0:34:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that's cool!
